post.description:
Sample request:

    POST /scan/graph/property/name
    {
       "operator": 0,
       "literal": {
         "value": "John Doe",
         "fullQualifiedTypeName": "System.String"
       },
       "resultType": "Vertices"
    }

The optional "label" field restricts the scan to elements whose label matches exactly
(e.g. "person"); omit it to scan every element type.

Sample request:

    POST /scan/index/all
    {
       "indexId": "userNameIndex",
       "operator": 0,
       "literal": {
         "value": "Jane",
         "fullQualifiedTypeName": "System.String"
       },
       "resultType": "Vertices"
    }

The optional "label" field restricts the hits to elements whose label matches exactly
(e.g. "person"); omit it to return every match.

Sample request:

    POST /scan/index/fulltext
    {
       "indexId": "documentIndex",
       "requestString": "graph database nosql"
    }

put.description:
